    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**3. 矢量与标量的乘法** 矢量$\\vec{a}$与标量$k$的乘积是一个矢量，其大小等于矢量的模与标量因子的乘积：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 19,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0031#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "**3. 矢量与标量的乘法**　矢量$\\vec{a}$与标量$k$的乘积是一个矢量，其大小等于矢量的模与标量因子的乘积：",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$|k\\vec{a}|=|k|\\cdot|\\vec{a}|$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 19,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0031#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "$|k\\vec{a}|=|k|\\cdot|\\vec{a}|$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果$k$是正的，则矢量$k\\vec{a}$的方向与矢量$\\vec{a}$相同；\n如果$k$是负的，则矢量$k\\vec{a}$的方向与矢量$\\vec{a}$的方向相反.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 19,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0031#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "如果$k$是正的，则矢量$k\\vec{a}$的方向与矢量$\\vec{a}$相同；如果$k$是负的，则矢量$k\\vec{a}$的方向与矢量$\\vec{a}$的方向相反.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "矢量$\\vec{b}=k\\vec{a}$在轴上的投影等于矢量$\\vec{a}$在这个轴上的投影乘以$k$：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 19,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0031#11",
        "p0032#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "矢量$\\vec{b}=k\\vec{a}$在轴上的投影等于矢量$\\vec{a}$在这个轴上的投影乘以$k$：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$b_x=ka_x$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 20,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0032#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "$b_x=ka_x$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "总之，矢量的运算是根据几何法则.\n矢量投影的运算也是根据代数学的一般法则.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 20,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0032#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "总之，矢量的运算是根据几何法则. 矢量投影的运算也是根据几何学的一般法则.",
      "changes": [
        "layout",
        "math-correction"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果已知矢量$\\vec{a}$在坐标轴上的投影$a_x$和$a_y$（图 23），则该矢量的绝对值等于",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 20,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0032#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "如果已知矢量$\\vec{a}$在坐标轴上的投影$a_x$和$a_y$（图 23），则该矢量的绝对值等于",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$|\\vec{a}|=\\sqrt{a_x^2+a_y^2}$ （毕达哥拉定理）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 20,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0032#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "$|\\vec{a}|=\\sqrt{a_x^2+a_y^2}$　（毕达哥拉定理）.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
